    "unit_failed": 1,
    "finding": "The existing agent retry test waited for synchronous onCreated, then read the input before React committed the subsequent queued reset. Failure was Name still containing the retained draft, after acknowledged persistence and callback count passed.",
    "correction": "Await the same empty Name value using the existing waitFor helper and default timeout. No application behavior, assertion condition or timeout changed; native and bundle checks were not reached in that attempt."
